[{"id":2795209738,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mm4QK","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"I think it's fine to do it outside of `is_inside_tree()`. However, my only concern is that `on_skeleton_update()` might be called twice (from inside `_check_bind()`) when `is_inside_tree()` is `true`.\r\n\r\nSo how about:\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid BoneAttachment3D::set_bone_idx(const int &p_idx) {\r\n\tif (is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\t\t_check_unbind();\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tbone_idx = p_idx;\r\n\r\n\tSkeleton3D *sk = get_skeleton();\r\n\tif (sk) {\r\n\t\tif (bone_idx <= -1 || bone_idx >= sk->get_bone_count()) {\r\n\t\t\tWARN_PRINT(\"Bone index out of range! Cannot connect BoneAttachment to node!\");\r\n\t\t\tbone_idx = -1;\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\tbone_name = sk->get_bone_name(bone_idx);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tif (is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\t\t_check_bind();\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\ton_skeleton_update();\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tnotify_property_list_changed();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104209#pullrequestreview-2795209738","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104209","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-25T20:23:49Z"},{"id":2795774640,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mpCKw","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","follower